      "reviewtitle": "Shine On You Crazy Diamond & Bathtub Gin (?) Jams",
      "reviewbody": "Absolutely stellar show. I also caught the Connecticut show, but this one had the jams I love from JRAD. The \u201cShine On You Crazy Diamond\u201d Pink Floyd jam in \u201cViola Lee Blues\u201d was brilliant, and the jam in \u201cThe Other One\u201d was reminiscent of Phish\u2019s \u201cBathtub Gin\u201d. These guys are phenomenal. Thank you for recording and sharing! ",
